    },
    {
     "text": "Subject: Northwind Industrial plant throughput, fourth quarter",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 347.62,
     "w": 560.41,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Bottom line",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 426.61,
     "w": 137.11,
     "h": 33.98
    },
    {
     "text": "Northwind Industrial raised plant throughput by 12 percent over the fourth quarter, from",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 465.7,
     "w": 798.95,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "41,200 to 46,100 units, while scrap fell from 3.1 percent to 2.4 percent. The gain came mostly",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 496.9,
     "w": 836.32,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "from the second assembly line, which ran two full shifts for the first time.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 527.62,
     "w": 654.33,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Assembly line two",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 606.61,
     "w": 212.46,
     "h": 33.98
    },
    {
     "text": "Line two produced 21,800 units in the quarter against a plan of 19,500. Changeover time",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 645.7,
     "w": 792.2,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "dropped from 38 minutes to 26 after the fixture rack was moved next to the press. Maintenance",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 676.9,
     "w": 861.12,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "logged four stoppages, all under an hour.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 707.62,
     "w": 368.01,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Scrap and rework",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 786.61,
     "w": 203.54,
     "h": 33.98
    },
    {
     "text": "Scrap fell by 0.7 points. Most of the improvement is in the bracket family, where the new gauge",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 825.7,
     "w": 855.45,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "catches out-of-tolerance parts before paint. Rework hours are flat at about 310 per month.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 856.42,
     "w": 813.76,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Next steps",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 935.41,
     "w": 122.57,
     "h": 33.98
    },
    {
     "text": "Extend the second-shift schedule to line three in February, and review the bracket gauge results",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 974.98,
     "w": 857.52,
     "h": 26.95
    },
    {
     "text": "at the end of March before buying a second unit.",
     "x": 180,
     "y": 1005.7,
     "w": 437.36,
     "h": 26.95
    }
   ]
  }
